  "original_image_inputs": [],
  "ownership": "Final pixel centers use the shared polygon (25,0),(71,0),(96,40),(71,80),(25,80),(0,40). Complementary top-left half-open ownership: cross(edge,point)\u003e0; edge ties include dy\u003c0 or dy==0 \u0026\u0026 dx\u003e0. Owned pixels are alpha 255; outside is zero RGBA. No outline, edge fade or per-scene filtering.",
  "profile": "fog-v1: fixed opaque never-seen candidate, runtime ID unseen only. Each of unseen/summer/winter independently uses unchanged exportConnectionTiles with its opaque source mapped to grass and nil family/variant; no feature rendering. New 96x80 polygon, four world pixels of unmasked overscan at 4x (416x352); unchanged premultiplied byte-RGB antialiased Lanczos3 to whole unmasked 2x overscan (208x176); crop then final binary ownership at each density. Existing continuous mirror-periodic material sampler with periods (142,80) and average f(x,y), f(x+71,y+40); invariant under all six lattice neighbor shifts, all tiles at common world phase. Six fixed seven-hex patches, decoded exported PNGs and ordinary image.Draw Over only; pixel-aligned 2x/4x. Runtime integration remains open.",
  "resampling_chain": [
    "opaque source -\u003e unmasked 4x overscan 416x352: unchanged lattice material sampler",
    "whole unmasked 4x -\u003e whole unmasked 2x 208x176: unchanged resizeLanczos (Lanczos3)",
    "crop four world pixels per side, then final polygon ownership independently at 4x 384x320 and 2x 192x160",
    "decode exported tile PNG bytes -\u003e ordinary image.Draw Over patches, no filtering"
  ],
